msgid "PEP 3110: Exception-Handling Changes"
msgstr "PEP 3110: 例外処理の変更"

#: ../../whatsnew/2.6.rst:902
msgid ""
"One error that Python programmers occasionally make is writing the following "
"code::"
msgstr ""
