"were not necessarily correct for all applications.  Code using :mod:`!"
"xmlrpclib` should convert :class:`~datetime.date` and :class:`~datetime."
"time` instances. (:issue:`1330538`)  The code can also handle dates before "
"1900 (contributed by Ralf Schmitt; :issue:`2014`) and 64-bit integers "
"represented by using ``<i8>`` in XML-RPC responses (contributed by Riku "
"Lindblad; :issue:`2985`)."
msgstr ""

