"The :meth:`~zipfile.ZipFile.open`, :meth:`~zipfile.ZipFile.read` and :meth:"
"`~zipfile.ZipFile.extract` methods can now take either a filename or a :"
"class:`~zipfile.ZipInfo` object.  This is useful when an archive "
